      ],
      "source": "https://www.visitdeepcreek.com/friendsville/",
      "category": "culture",
      "quality": "good"
    },
    {
      "id": 5,
      "text": "The Garrett County Celtic Festival takes place each June at Riverside Community Park, showcasing Celtic music and Irish dancers.",
